Package: python3-llama-cpp-python
Architecture: all
Depends:
 python3-llama-cpp-python-core (= ${binary:Version}),
 python3-llama-cpp-python-backend-cpu (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3-starlette-context (>= 0.5.1)
Description: Python bindings for llama.cpp (default runtime)
 This package installs the llama-cpp-python runtime together with the
 dynamically selected CPU backend.
 .
 Optional accelerator backends are provided by separate packages.

Package: python3-llama-cpp-python-core
Architecture: any
Breaks:
