 python3-jinja2,
 python3-typing-extensions
Description: Python bindings for llama.cpp - core runtime
 This package contains the Python modules and common llama.cpp/ggml shared
 libraries. Hardware-specific backends are packaged separately.

Package: python3-llama-cpp-python-backend-cpu
Architecture: any
Breaks:
 python3-llama-cpp-vulkan (<< ${binary:Version}),
 python3-llama-cpp-cuda (<< ${binary:Version})
Replaces:
 python3-llama-cpp-vulkan (<< ${binary:Version}),
 python3-llama-cpp-cuda (<< ${binary:Version})
Depends:
 python3-llama-cpp-python-core (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: llama-cpp-python dynamic CPU backend
 This package contains dynamically selected CPU backends for llama-cpp-python.
 On x86-64, llama.cpp selects the best supported implementation at runtime.

Package: python3-llama-cpp-python-backend-vulkan
Architecture: any
Breaks:
 python3-llama-cpp-vulkan (<< ${binary:Version})
Replaces:
 python3-llama-cpp-vulkan (<< ${binary:Version})
Depends:
 python3-llama-cpp-python (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: llama-cpp-python dynamic Vulkan backend
 This package contains the dynamically loadable Vulkan backend for
 llama-cpp-python. The Vulkan loader runtime is pulled in through shared
 library dependencies.

Package: python3-llama-cpp-python-backend-cuda12.4
Architecture: any
Provides: python3-llama-cpp-python-backend-cuda (= ${binary:Version})
Depends:
 python3-llama-cpp-python (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: llama-cpp-python dynamic CUDA 12.4 backend
 This package contains the dynamically loadable CUDA backend for
 llama-cpp-python, built with the CUDA 12.4 toolkit from Debian Trixie.
 Multiple versioned CUDA backend packages may be installed in parallel;
 update-alternatives selects the default CUDA backend.

Package: python3-llama-cpp-python-backend-cuda12.9
Architecture: any
Provides: python3-llama-cpp-python-backend-cuda (= ${binary:Version})
Depends:
